    "sharedPassage": {
      "text": "Good afternoon. This is Grace from the Cedar Kitchen, calling about your Saturday lunch. You wanted the upstairs room so your team could run a short slide show. The lift to that room will be out of service. If anyone needs step-free access, we can set up a screen in the garden room instead. Both rooms have the same menu.\n\nI see that you’re bringing a cake. We can keep it in the fridge, but the kitchen staff can only take it in before eleven. Your friend is due at eleven thirty. If she can’t come earlier, please ask her to keep the cake with her until you’re ready to serve it.\n\nOne more thing: we can put food on one bill and drinks on another, but we can’t bill guests individually. Tell me which of those two bills should go to your office.",
